# Keep the build context small: everything here is unused by the build or
# the running app. Coolify/Nixpacks honours this file.

# Product photos: /app/public/uploads is a Coolify persistent volume, which
# hides whatever the image ships there, and the prebuild skips it
# (IMAGE_VARIANTS_SKIP_UPLOADS=1). Shipping the git copy (~200 MB) only
# slowed every deploy.
public/uploads

# Dev-only material
.git
node_modules
build
scratch
screenshots
test-results
playwright-report
graphify-out
caddy.exe
*.log
